'''Lone Cat and Kitten ''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] who was implemented in [[Version 7.5 Update|Version 7.5]] and can be unlocked after beating the stage [[Bombergirl (Deadly)|Deeply Dreaming]] appearing on the '''9th''', '''10th''', '''23rd''' and '''24th''' of every month. [[True Form]] was added in [[Version 8.10 Update|Version 8.10]] and increases health and freeze duration.

