==Trivia==
*Lone Cat and Kitten are a reference to the main characters of ''Lone Wolf and Cub'', a manga series where Ogami Ittō tries to get revenge against the Yagyū clan. Ogami Ittō also walks around with his son; because of that, they are known as the "Lone Wolf and Cub".

